{"comments":[{"path":".devcontainer/devcontainer.json","content":"The devcontainer image is pinned only to a mutable tag (`mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/rust:0-1-bullseye`) rather than an immutable digest, so CI/dev environment reproduction can drift as the tag is republished. Pin the image by digest or build from a locked Dockerfile.","start_line":6,"end_line":6},{"path":".devcontainer/devcontainer.json","content":"`postCreateCommand` installs `just` without a version (`cargo install just`), so builds depend on the latest crates.io release at container creation time and may become non-reproducible or break unexpectedly. Pin a known version, e.g. `cargo install just --version ... --locked`.","start_line":20,"end_line":20}]}
